        <Dialogs>
          <Dialog>○○○○○○○○</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hey.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Anegasaki</Dialog>
          <Dialog>What？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I can't really picture
▲姉ヶ崎＊▲ as a little
kid.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Really？ I was just a normal
little kid, you know？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Well, I'm sure, but...</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hmm, but from how I am now,
maybe you can't tell.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Were you really different？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>I was super rambunctious.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>So, you were an active kid？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Yes. I was always running
around outside. I still have
scars from falling and
scraping myself, you know？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh... but you're an indoor
type now, right？ When did
that change？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>When, I wonder... ah, maybe
that.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>You see, I watched an old
movie at a relative's house.
A vampire one.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Vampires？</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Right. The vampire hunter in
it was an old man, but he
was super cool.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>After that, I started
watching horror, reading
books... and before I knew
it, I ended up like this.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Huh... one movie changed
you.</Dialog>
          <Dialog>Hehe. Encounters are
interesting, aren't they？</Dialog>
        </Dialogs>
